                                                                                
 Usage: opentide validate [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                           
                                                                                
 Validate objects and queries                                                   
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --check          CHECK                     Run one check only:               │
│                                            id-uniqueness, uuid-format,       │
│                                            schema, cve, sharing-config,      │
│                                            configuration, queries            │
│ --file           <str>                     Validate only this file           │
│                                            (repeatable)                      │
│ --uuid           <str>                     Validate only the object with     │
│                                            this UUID (repeatable)            │
│ --type           <str>                     Validate only this type: rule,    │
│                                            threat or objective (repeatable)  │
│ --strict                                   Fail on warnings too              │
│ --queries        error|warn|off            How a query the platform would    │
│                                            reject is reported: error (the    │
│                                            default), warn (passes unless     │
│                                            --strict) or off (queries are not │
│                                            checked)                          │
│ --fix                                      Apply every safe fix (vocabulary  │
│                                            typos), then validate again       │
│ --dry-run                                  With --fix: print the edits as a  │
│                                            diff and change nothing           │
│ --watch                                    Validate again each time an       │
│                                            object file changes; Ctrl-C stops │
│ --format         <text|sarif|codequality>  text: code frames. sarif: SARIF   │
│                                            2.1.0 for code scanning.          │
│                                            codequality: GitLab Code Quality  │
│                                            (Code Climate JSON). A report     │
│                                            goes to --output, or to stdout    │
│                                            instead of the text               │
│                                            [default: text]                   │
│ --output         <path>                    Write the --format report to this │
│                                            file and print the usual text     │
│                                            output too                        │
│ --help                                     Show this message and exit.       │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Commands ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ query  Check rule queries offline, or on the tenants (--live)                │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide validate
   $ opentide validate --strict --type rule
   $ opentide validate --queries warn
